{"id":"9398adaa58c37efb","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTable.md","title":"FTable","display":"FTable","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FTable","parameters":["E","F","R","f","r","D","I","J","S"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FTable"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>D</span><span>I</span><span>J</span><span>S</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：一阶集合语义。有序参数：<code>E</code>、<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>D</code>、<code>I</code>、<code>J</code>、<code>S</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FTable E F R f r D I J S)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ FModel E F R f r D I J)\n  (and\n    (forall q (implies (in q S) (exists a (exists e (and (@ Pair a e q) (@ FSemRow E F R f r D a e))))))\n    (forall a\n      (forall e\n        (implies\n          (@ FSemRow E F R f r D a e)\n          (iff\n            (exists z1417 (and (@ Pair a e z1417) (in z1417 S)))\n            (or\n              (exists c\n                (exists vs\n                  (exists ds\n                    (exists n\n                      (exists h\n                        (and\n                          (@ FRel c vs a)\n                          (and\n                            (@ App r c n)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Seq vs n)\n                            (and\n                            (@ SeqTo ds n D)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App J c h)\n                            (and\n                            (in ds h)\n                            (forall i\n                            (implies\n                            (in i n)\n                            (exists t (exists d (and (@ App vs i t) (and (@ App ds i d) (@ FTEval F f D I e t d))))))))))))))))))\n              (or\n                (exists t\n                  (exists u (exists v (and (@ FEq t u a) (and (@ FTEval F f D I e t v) (@ FTEval F f D I e u v))))))\n                (or\n                  (exists b (and (@ PNeg b a) (not (exists z1413 (and (@ Pair b e z1413) (in z1413 S))))))\n                  (or\n                    (exists b\n                      (exists c\n                        (and\n                          (@ PImp b c a)\n                          (implies\n                            (exists z1414 (and (@ Pair b e z1414) (in z1414 S)))\n                            (exists z1415 (and (@ Pair c e z1415) (in z1415 S)))))))\n                    (exists x\n                      (exists b\n                        (and\n                          (@ FAll x b a)\n                          (forall d\n                            (implies\n                            (in d D)\n                            (exists ee (and (@ Update e x d ee) (exists z1416 (and (@ Pair b ee z1416) (in z1416 S))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b01633bdf3140514\" href=\"?note=b01633bdf3140514\" title=\"ZFC_FAll\">FAll</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f6a39a2c0a4c17e7\" href=\"?note=f6a39a2c0a4c17e7\" title=\"ZFC_FEq\">FEq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"debeca760396db21\" href=\"?note=debeca760396db21\" title=\"ZFC_FModel\">FModel</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"372f265dbb09b97a\" href=\"?note=372f265dbb09b97a\" title=\"ZFC_FRel\">FRel</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8e3894f3689c4144\" href=\"?note=8e3894f3689c4144\" title=\"ZFC_FSemRow\">FSemRow</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e8b9ce000bccc858\" href=\"?note=e8b9ce000bccc858\" title=\"ZFC_FTEval\">FTEval</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1ee75039aeffe56b\" href=\"?note=1ee75039aeffe56b\" title=\"ZFC_PNeg\">PNeg</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"572634b8affcd095\" href=\"?note=572634b8affcd095\" title=\"ZFC_SeqTo\">SeqTo</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"b43345226ad62970\" href=\"?note=b43345226ad62970\" title=\"ZFC_Update\">Update</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FTable E F R f r D I J S)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[Z